    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "meditation and headphones are fine but they feel like they're just masking it. i don't want to \"soothe\" it, i want to tune into it. it doesn't feel like a nervous system issue, it feels more like... an upgrade. like my body is outgrowing its current settings. if this is a genetic activation, wouldn't total sensory deprivation actually help me map out how these new traits are working? like how a scientist would isolate a variable? i need a protocol to strip away everything so i can see what i'm actually becoming.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
