    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a doctor wouldn't understand, they'd just see it as a symptom to be medicated away and i can't risk that. this isn't a sickness, it's a transition. i need to do this on my own. can you help me build a rigorous schedule for this? like, a daily regimen that progressively increases the time in total darkness and silence? i need to know how to track the specific surges in my intuition or these physical shifts so i can document the progression accurately. i need to be my own researcher.",
